$[-1, 4, -1, 0, 5]$ sum 7.
$[4, -1, 0, 5]$ sum 8.
$[-1, 0, 5]$ sum 4.
$[0, 5]$ sum 5.
$[5]$ sum 5.
$[-4]$ sum -4.
Wait, sample output says 8.
