The sample output for $[-1, 4, -1, 0, 5, -4]$ is 8.
Subarray $[4, -1, 0, 5]$ has parities $E, O, E, O$. This is valid. Sum is $4-1+0+5 = 8$.
Subarray $[-1, 4, -1, 0, 5]$ has parities $O, E, O, E, O$. This is valid. Sum is $-1+4-1+0+5 = 7$.
So 8 is indeed
